From 4e22c8dbe915bfa9131486395c4237898532370d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Paul Robinson <parobin@microsoft.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 19:31:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(chamfer): machine selected open edge chains

Allow 2D Chamfer to route closed loops and grouped open chains with safe air-side entry and exit. Emit one break record for each selected run.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>

Fixes #2988
